  "original_query": "查询Jarvis.ceo桌面端的任务架构与现有开源接入，整理带来源的文档保存为research.md。请实际搜索并阅读相关官方资料，可参考这些固定版本源码：https://raw.githubusercontent.com/akshayaggarwal99/jarvis-ai-assistant/bec50ef6e615707613c4fa22c8bd6afc3cc93152/README.md, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/akshayaggarwal99/jarvis-ai-assistant/bec50ef6e615707613c4fa22c8bd6afc3cc93152/src/core/agent-manager.ts, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/akshayaggarwal99/jarvis-ai-assistant/bec50ef6e615707613c4fa22c8bd6afc3cc93152/src/agents/unified-agent.ts，以及现有执行底座的官方源码 https://raw.githubusercontent.com/open-jarvis/OpenJarvis/0eb7811df96cf139e6bd6d7fcc9b5cc4ff1418ff/src/openjarvis/agents/native_react.py。",
